ca_dorsal_flower_canopy|body_geometry|body.appendages.back.flower_leaf_order|nonhuman|one dorsal flower above a broad leaf canopy|등의 넓은 잎 덮개 위에 놓인 한 꽃|one flower's petals spread above a broad leaf canopy on the declared creature's back;a visible stem section lies between that flower and the leaf layer|a selected nonhuman back design carries one petaled flower higher than a wide leaf layer;the intervening stalk remains visible above the leaves|지정한 생물의 등 디자인에서 넓은 잎 덮개 위로 한 꽃의 꽃잎이 벌어진다;그 꽃과 잎 층 사이에 보이는 줄기 구간이 남는다|a handheld bouquet;an unseen stem-to-body root asserted beneath leaves
ca_membrane_wings|body_geometry|body.appendages.wings.rib_membrane_relation|nonhuman|paired membrane wings with branching supports|갈라진 지지선이 있는 한 쌍 막 날개|two membrane wings spread from the declared creature's back region;continuous membrane panels fill the spaces between branching wing supports|a selected nonhuman design has two back wings with thin continuous surfaces;the wing surfaces span between their separate branching ribs|지정한 생물의 등 영역에서 막 날개 두 개가 벌어진다;연속된 막 면이 갈라진 날개 지지선 사이의 공간을 메운다|layered feathers;a cape floating beside the arms
